    <page type="text">
        <text>Welcome to the only edition of Nature and You: Alfheim x Tinker's Construct. Within these pages you will find everything you need to effectively harness the power of nature with all of your botanist skills.

This book is a magic copy; it updates whenever the original has been modified. Check back occasionally for information on new things.</text>
    </page>

    <page type="sectionpage">
        <title>Natural Material Traits</title>
        <text>Some materials have traits that augment their natural uses.

 - Manarepair: Uses Mana to restore tool durability
 - Manaregen: Passive Mana generation on Mana Tablets
 - Pixie Call: 10% chance to summon a pixie</text>
    </page>

