        <title>Auto-Repair</title>
        <text>The tool with Mana Infusion Core attaching to it appears to be capable of regenerating wear and tear at the cost of some mana.

 Effects:
 - The tool repairs itself

 Type: Single-use
 Stackable: No</text>
